Comment: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人...
Comment: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天還是沒回來呢
Comment: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明說雜事今天就能辦完的...
Comment: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個表情 果然是有什麼事
Comment: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能這樣放著不管
Comment: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要有我黑子能做到的
Comment: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管姐姐大人再怎麼反對...
Comment: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不
Comment: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我之前決定了啊
Comment: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要等待...
Comment: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳究竟怎麼了
Comment: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...這下不妙
Comment: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被姐姐大人的香氣環繞著 不禁意識開始模糊...
Comment: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不該這樣
Comment: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子我現在應該要再思考一次該怎麼做
Comment: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來...來了
Comment: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,宿舍有客人來還真是難得啊
Comment: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來了
Comment: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那...那個
Comment: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是上條
Comment: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是御坂嗎?
Comment: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:22.22,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:52.48,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳好
Comment: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這真的有接通嗎?
Comment: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這張臉...
Comment: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是上次對姐姐大人出手的類人猿
Comment: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,莫非是被姐姐大人的美貌吸引而追來的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人可能正身處險境 這猿人還真是氣定神閒啊!
Comment: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且那時候我之所以會放過他
Comment: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是想讓姐姐大人增強對男人的免疫力
Comment: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他本來就是該要被立刻排除的存在
Comment: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一下!
Comment: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說不定他知道關於姐姐大人的事情...
Comment: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是208...吧?
Comment: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好痛 不要這樣
Comment: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然我決定了要等待 就算知道了也...
Comment: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.82,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要鬧啦
Comment: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:35.54,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,冷靜一點
Comment: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是...是上條同學吧?
Comment: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕
Comment: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然搞錯房間號碼了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不不 你沒搞錯
Comment: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你有事來找姐姐大人吧
Comment: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我和姐姐大人是室友
Comment: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼說
Comment: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂還沒回來嗎?
Comment: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過應該快回來了
Comment: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果你有事的話 建議你可以進來等
Comment: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就這樣錯過了也不好
Comment: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且 門限時間一到 保全系統就會啟動
Comment: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到時候你就沒辦法在外面等了
Comment: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請進
Comment: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,門沒有鎖
Comment: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請自己打開吧
Comment: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那...那個...
Comment: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快點進來 然後把門關上
Comment: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很抱歉
Comment: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這房間本來就只是用來休息的
Comment: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以沒有什麼能招待客人的東西
Comment: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然要等姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就請你坐在旁邊那張床上等吧
Comment: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不 這樣不太好吧
Comment: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有得到本人的許可就...
Comment: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不用擔心
Comment: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是我的床
Comment: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在幹什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然在別人的床上亂滾
Comment: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是變態啊?
Comment: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你說我是變態 我可不能當作沒聽到啊
Comment: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人們嘴上都說不能這麼做
Comment: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但其實心裡都認為這樣做是沒什麼大不了的
Comment: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,偷親自己喜歡的女孩的直笛
Comment: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,或是偷走她腳踏車的坐墊
Comment: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才不會咧
Comment: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要太大聲說話比較好喔
Comment: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果被聽到就糟糕了
Comment: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,賀啦賀啦
Comment: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說
Comment: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽妳叫她姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還以為妳是她學妹呢
Comment: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然住同個房間 應該同年級吧?
Comment: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不
Comment: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我確實是姐姐大人的學妹唷
Comment: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是讓之前那位室友搬出去了而已
Comment: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是透過合法手段
Comment: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好恐怖
Comment: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你來找姐姐大人有什麼事情嗎?
Comment: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請等一下!
Comment: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然還是不用說了
Comment: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽了也沒用 我心意已決
Comment: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟...糟糕
Comment: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像來巡樓了
Comment: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果被舍監知道你在這裡 事情會很不妙的
Comment: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,舍監?
Comment: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是個會搞突擊檢查的既邪惡又危險的人物
Comment: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉 只能強制讓你出去了
Comment: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼我的能力對你無效...
Comment: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個 那是因為...
Comment: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩死了
Comment: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你乾脆給我躲在床底下吧
Comment: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太勉強了 這縫隙...
Comment: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好痛
Comment: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,塞也要塞進去
Comment: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我好像聽到有什麼動靜
Comment: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,確實有呢
Comment: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是隔壁發出的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂已經睡了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說是最近到了半夜就睡不著
Comment: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛入睡不久
Comment: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也希望能安靜一點
Comment: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請讓我去隔壁抱怨幾句吧!
