Comment: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1082,980)}Level 6 Shift
Comment: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.62,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,指的就是嗶哩嗶哩吧
Comment: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然
Comment: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是不可能有128名超電磁砲的
Comment: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:54.46,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1177,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此進行了量產型「妹妹們」的開發
Comment: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.70,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1113,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:07:58.65,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,於是
Comment: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一方通行只要殺害兩萬具「妹妹們」
Comment: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1296,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(593,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就能進化為絕對能力者...
Comment: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.89,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1081,980)}Level 6
Comment: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是「妹妹們」喔
Comment: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.03,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂回答道
Comment: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,10030
Comment: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,8月20日
Comment: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,22:30
Comment: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,10031
Comment: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,8月21日
Comment: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後 今天死亡的是
Comment: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,編號10031
Comment: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,10032
Comment: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,8月21日
Comment: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,20:30
Comment: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的...
Comment: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那隻死猴子
Comment: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡又不是叢林
Comment: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到最後
Comment: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是什麼都沒有問到...
Comment: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那傢伙
Comment: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道這個計畫
Comment: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳到底...!?
Comment: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道有自己的複製人存在
Comment: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我 超討厭那艘飛船的
Comment: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為人類竟然在遵守機械所訂下的政策
Comment: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她知道這個實驗...知道這個計畫...
Comment: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明就沒有風
Comment: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電磁波!!
Comment: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼...
Comment: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會變成這個樣子啊
Comment: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我能做到的...
Comment: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能不再有犧牲者出現的方法...
Comment: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是...
Comment: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果這樣還阻止不了的話
Comment: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就...
Comment: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救我...
Comment: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救救我啊...
Comment: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,貓?
Comment: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在做什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幹嘛突然這樣問?
Comment: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要做什麼是我的自由吧
Comment: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過就是夜遊而已 根本沒有理由在這裡聽你...
Comment: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要這樣了
Comment: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「不要這樣」是指什麼 事到如今...
Comment: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂妹的事情
Comment: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妹妹們的事情
Comment: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.60,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(867,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗的內容 我都看過了
Comment: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們都別拐彎抹角了
Comment: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...
Comment: 0,0:10:59.30,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你...
Comment: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被這傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道了
Comment: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你到底是什麼角色啊
Comment: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明昨天才遇到我的複製人而已
Comment: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,居然就已經查到了這種地步
Comment: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以去當偵探了你
Comment: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,愛多管閒事的你
Comment: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不會容許這個實驗吧
Comment: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過你拿到這份文件就表示說
Comment: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你擅自跑進我的房間對吧
Comment: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從你的角度來看
Comment: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是提供DNA圖譜的實驗幫兇
Comment: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以你是來責備我的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,居然還翻到玩偶身上
Comment: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要處你死刑喔 死刑
Comment: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,算了
Comment: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算和事實有差距
Comment: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從結果來看是一樣的
Comment: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話
Comment: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,乾脆讓別人責罵一頓還比較舒服
Comment: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好 所以說
Comment: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你是覺得我不可原諒對吧
Comment: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在說什麼?
Comment: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然是在擔心妳啊
Comment: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是說謊
Comment: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但有人對我這麼說
Comment: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓我多少比較好受...
Comment: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才沒說謊
Comment: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就說我沒說謊 是沒聽懂嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.03,Default,break,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:47.28,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們啊...
Comment: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還面不改色地說自己是「實驗動物」
Comment: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像白老鼠或天竺鼠那樣
Comment: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了研究 全身都被任意玩弄
Comment: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒用了就丟到焚化爐去
Comment: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們...
Comment: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們能正確地理解什麼叫「實驗動物」
Comment: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們明明知道
Comment: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻還是這麼稱呼自己
Comment: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓這種情況發生的是我
Comment: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們...
Comment: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,必須用我的雙手去拯救她們
Comment: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳要去哪裡?
Comment: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今天晚上也有實驗會進行
Comment: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這之前
Comment: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要用我僅有的手段
Comment: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去和一方通行分出勝負
Comment: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.52,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(902.4,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳贏得了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他們說 妳會死在第185招
Comment: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是樹狀圖設計者預測演算後所寫的
Comment: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.91,Default-furigana,furi,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(777,980)}Tree diagram
Comment: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳真的覺得
Comment: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打得贏他嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,很遺憾
Comment: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算我竭盡全力 他依舊毫髮無傷
Comment: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果我連這個價值都沒有的話
Comment: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比如說
Comment: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在他的第一招就輸掉的話
Comment: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「死在第185招」的預測結果就會被推翻
Comment: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果看到這個結果 讓研究員對計畫產生疑問
Comment: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打算重新模擬的話
Comment: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的我
Comment: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是還有剩餘的用處嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...
Comment: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打算去死嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算妳死了
Comment: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳覺得這樣就可以阻止這個計畫嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道嗎 對那些研究員來說
Comment: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,樹狀圖設計者的預測結果就是絕對的
Comment: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.61,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(655,980)}Tree diagram
Comment: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果說我在第一招就慘敗 只能在地上爬著四處逃竄的話
Comment: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,研究員們一定會這麼想
Comment: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「樹狀圖設計者的預測演算也是會有錯誤的」
Comment: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.43,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(594,980)}Tree diagram
Comment: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話
Comment: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果說再重新演算的話 妳不就白死了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可能
Comment: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,樹狀圖設計者在約三個禮拜前就不知道被什麼東西擊落了
Comment: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:03.23,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(381,980)}Tree diagram
Comment: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以已經不可能再重新演算了
Comment: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...
Comment: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,連這個都...
Comment: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以知道了吧
Comment: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓開
Comment: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不行
Comment: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先不管妳去打倒一方通行這件事
Comment: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.27,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1083,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不能放任抱著必死決心的人離開
Comment: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要不然
Comment: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你是有什麼其他方法嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明什麼都做不到
Comment: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要光說些漂亮話和理想論
Comment: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽了就不爽
Comment: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是這樣
Comment: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還是不會讓開
Comment: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你還真是難以溝通耶
Comment: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道說
Comment: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你覺得那些複製人死掉也無所謂嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果你還想要阻撓我的話 我就先在這裡把你打倒
Comment: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不想被我電的話就給我閃開
Comment: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是嗎... 看來你是想來硬的
Comment: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,確實到目前為止我一次都沒有贏過你
Comment: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就連現在也不知道你身上到底有什麼能力
Comment: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是這次我是絕對不會輸的
Comment: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以你也給我認真打
Comment: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,否則的話...
Comment: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你會死的
Comment: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:20.67,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,你這是在幹嘛?
Comment: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...
Comment: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是不會跟妳打的
Comment: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會跟妳打
Comment: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你真的是笨蛋嗎?
Comment: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你以為這樣做我就不會對你出手了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我已經沒有別條路可以走了
Comment: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管你有沒有抵抗 你敢阻撓我 我一定把你打倒
Comment: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是這樣
Comment: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也不會跟你打
Comment: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,少給我開玩笑了
Comment: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想跟我打的話就給我握緊拳頭
Comment: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不想打的話就不要給我擋在那裡
Comment: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要用那種半吊子的心態來踐踏別人的希望!!
Comment: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我叫你...
Comment: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給我動手啊!!
Comment: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,騙人...
Comment: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的攻擊明明不可能對他有效
Comment: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這和平常攻擊被抵消的感覺不一樣
Comment: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有貫穿他身體的觸感...
Comment: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣你懂了吧
Comment: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是真的會把你...
Comment: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼...
Comment: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我說過了
Comment: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不會跟妳打
Comment: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼啊??
Comment: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你也知道這個瘋狂的實驗是不對的吧
Comment: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你不是應該也要阻止它的嗎 為什麼要阻止我?
Comment: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是啊 是不對的
Comment: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了這種事情
Comment: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,居然去傷害別人
Comment: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這樣的話
Comment: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳的作法
Comment: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻救不了妳自己
Comment: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不會讓開
Comment: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你在說什麼啊...
Comment: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我已經...
Comment: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事到如今 我已經沒有再聽到這種話的資格了
Comment: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是...
Comment: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所有人都能笑著的幸福世界
Comment: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也沒有我的容身之地啊
Comment: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣子...
Comment: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳覺得剩下來的妹妹們
Comment: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的會感謝妳嗎?
Comment: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳自己也注意到了吧
Comment: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳這種做法
Comment: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,救不了任何人
Comment: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你很囉唆耶...
Comment: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們也...
Comment: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果我死掉的話也比較輕鬆
Comment: 0,0:18:58.61,0:18:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經...
Comment: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只剩下我死掉這個方法了
Comment: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能用一個人的命去救一萬個人不是很棒嗎?
Comment: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣就好了啊...
Comment: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請你讓開...
Comment: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不會讓開
Comment: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你果然是個笨蛋啊
Comment: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明就跟你毫無關係
Comment: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明只要閉上眼睛
Comment: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,裝做什麼都不知道
Comment: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就可以回到往常的生活
Comment: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼還要把自己弄得遍體麟傷的
Comment: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說不定連心臟
Comment: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都短暫的停止跳動了
Comment: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼你還露得出笑容啊
Comment: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為很高興妳還能站在我這邊啊
Comment: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以啊
Comment: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,別哭了
Comment: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想到了
Comment: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,阻止實驗的方法
Comment: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個實驗
Comment: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是以一方通行為最強的前提之下
Comment: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.80,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(776,980)}Accelerator
Comment: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去進行模擬演算的
Comment: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要去證明「其實他超弱」
Comment: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比如說
Comment: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果他隨便輸給一個學園都市裡面的無能力者的話
Comment: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.34,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1392,980)}Level 0
Comment: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個前提不就能被推翻了嗎
Comment: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一下...
Comment: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你該不會要...
Comment: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我...
Comment: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去跟他打
Comment: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不可能!!
Comment: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他跟我是不同次元的人
Comment: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他是能輕鬆和全世界的軍隊為敵的怪物啊
Comment: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次你真的會...
Comment: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管什麼事情都會幫我解決的媽媽不在這裡
Comment: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,求求你...
Comment: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不能讓別人捲進我讓一萬人死掉的罪過中
Comment: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就算是求神明
Comment: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不會有奇蹟發生
Comment: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這件事情
Comment: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,必須要由我自己一個人解決
Comment: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就協助我吧
Comment: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不失去任何東西
Comment: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓大家帶著笑容回來是我的夢想
Comment: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託妳幫我實現這個夢想
Comment: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要哭喊
Comment: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就會趕來救我的英雄根本就...
Comment: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳等著
Comment: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我一定會把御坂妹妹帶回來
Comment: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就這麼說定了
Comment: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗開始時間
Comment: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是8點半
Comment: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,過來吧
Comment: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,過來吧
Comment: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:53.10,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:38.77,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不認為我有勝算
Comment: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為那個瘋狂計畫她們...
Comment: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們就得死的話...
Comment: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,首先 就讓我來摧毀那愚蠢至極的幻想
Comment: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:45.01,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:45.01,0:23:47.01,staff,export,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.25,effect 04,eff,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs40\pos(514,615)}運用量產超能力者「妹妹們」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.25,effect 04,eff,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs40\pos(514,670)}讓超能力者「一方通行」進化為絕對能力的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.03,ADT,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs100\pos(436.8,497.2)}約\N定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:35.21,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}忘れたい答え あがいたって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:40.71,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}君はもういない 日々だった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:45.93,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}何もできなくてありがとうも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:51.83,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}言えず堪えた泪は落ちた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:56.49,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}「あとほんの少し...」つけた指輪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:23:01.13,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}このままでいてお願い
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:06.65,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}泣いたってもうなにも戻ってこないって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.83,0:23:13.51,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}何度言っても私の心　理解しない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:20.31,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}描いた未来の二人が邪魔してくるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.89,SED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}痛いほどに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:35.21,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}想要遺忘的答案 如今依舊鮮明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:40.71,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}卻已經過著沒有你的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:45.93,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}什麼都沒辦法為你做 甚至是道謝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:51.83,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)\3c&H2090E7&}還沒開口 隱忍的淚水已落下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:56.49,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}「差那麼一點點...」 已戴上的戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:23:01.13,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}祈求就這樣保持現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:06.65,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}即使哭泣 也無法挽回什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.83,0:23:13.51,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}不管說了幾次 你還是無法理解我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:20.31,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}當時描繪出我們兩人的未來 那景象總是會來擾亂我的思緒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.89,SED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(300,300)}痛徹心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.25,0:23:40.02,下一回,next,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx70\pos(149.6,620)}上\N條\N當\N麻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天還是沒回來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明說雜事今天就能辦完的...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個表情 果然是有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不能這樣放著不管
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要有我黑子能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管姐姐大人再怎麼反對...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我之前決定了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要等待...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳究竟怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這...這下不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被姐姐大人的香氣環繞著 不禁意識開始模糊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不該這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}黑子我現在應該要再思考一次該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來...來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}宿舍有客人來還真是難得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那...那個
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是上條
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是御坂嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這真的有接通嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這張臉...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是上次對姐姐大人出手的類人猿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}莫非是被姐姐大人的美貌吸引而追來的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人可能正身處險境 這猿人還真是氣定神閒啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且那時候我之所以會放過他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是想讓姐姐大人增強對男人的免疫力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他本來就是該要被立刻排除的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說不定他知道關於姐姐大人的事情...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是208...吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好痛 不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然我決定了要等待 就算知道了也...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.82,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要鬧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:35.54,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是...是上條同學吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然搞錯房間號碼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不不 你沒搞錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你有事來找姐姐大人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我和姐姐大人是室友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂還沒回來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過應該快回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果你有事的話 建議你可以進來等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就這樣錯過了也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且 門限時間一到 保全系統就會啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到時候你就沒辦法在外面等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請進
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}門沒有鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請自己打開吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那...那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}快點進來 然後把門關上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這房間本來就只是用來休息的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以沒有什麼能招待客人的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然要等姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就請你坐在旁邊那張床上等吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不 這樣不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有得到本人的許可就...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是我的床
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在幹什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}竟然在別人的床上亂滾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳是變態啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你說我是變態 我可不能當作沒聽到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人們嘴上都說不能這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但其實心裡都認為這樣做是沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}偷親自己喜歡的女孩的直笛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}或是偷走她腳踏車的坐墊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才不會咧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要太大聲說話比較好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果被聽到就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}賀啦賀啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽妳叫她姐姐大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還以為妳是她學妹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然住同個房間 應該同年級吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我確實是姐姐大人的學妹唷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是讓之前那位室友搬出去了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是透過合法手段
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你來找姐姐大人有什麼事情嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請等一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}果然還是不用說了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽了也沒用 我心意已決
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟...糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好像來巡樓了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果被舍監知道你在這裡 事情會很不妙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}舍監?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是個會搞突擊檢查的既邪惡又危險的人物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉 只能強制讓你出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼我的能力對你無效...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個 那是因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}麻煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你乾脆給我躲在床底下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太勉強了 這縫隙...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}塞也要塞進去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我好像聽到有什麼動靜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}確實有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是隔壁發出的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂已經睡了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說是最近到了半夜就睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛剛入睡不久
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也希望能安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請讓我去隔壁抱怨幾句吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}病理解析研究所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}第七藥學研究中心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超電磁砲量產計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.52,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(960,980)}Radio Noise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一方通行向絕對能力進化的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:12.10,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(654,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:12.10,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1021,980)}Level 6 Shift
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}絕對能力者?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:14.07,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(952,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不是這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是樓上嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明現在根本沒閒工夫做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}學園都市七人的超能力者中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.09,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1147.2,980)}Level 5
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只有一方通行能進化成絕對能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.08,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(716,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.08,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1267.2,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}根據樹狀圖設計者的演算結果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要在128種戰場上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}殺害超電磁砲128次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:43.82,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(930,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就能達成絕對能力者進化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.74,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1082,980)}Level 6 Shift
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}超電磁砲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.62,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(960,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}指的就是嗶哩嗶哩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是不可能有128名超電磁砲的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:54.46,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1177,980)}Railgun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因此進行了量產型「妹妹們」的開發
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.70,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1113,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}於是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一方通行只要殺害兩萬具「妹妹們」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1296,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.16,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(593,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就能進化為絕對能力者...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.89,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1081,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是「妹妹們」喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.03,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(960,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂回答道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}10030
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}8月20日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}22:30
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}10031
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}8月21日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}然後 今天死亡的是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}編號10031
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}10032
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}8月21日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}20:30
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那隻死猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡又不是叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是什麼都沒有問到...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}知道這個計畫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳到底...!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}知道有自己的複製人存在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我 超討厭那艘飛船的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為人類竟然在遵守機械所訂下的政策
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她知道這個實驗...知道這個計畫...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明就沒有風
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}電磁波!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼會變成這個樣子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我能做到的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}能不再有犧牲者出現的方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果這樣還阻止不了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救我...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救救我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}貓?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在做什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幹嘛突然這樣問?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要做什麼是我的自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過就是夜遊而已 根本沒有理由在這裡聽你...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「不要這樣」是指什麼 事到如今...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂妹的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妹妹們的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.60,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(867,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}實驗的內容 我都看過了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我們都別拐彎抹角了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被這傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你到底是什麼角色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明昨天才遇到我的複製人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}居然就已經查到了這種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可以去當偵探了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}愛多管閒事的你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不會容許這個實驗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過你拿到這份文件就表示說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你擅自跑進我的房間對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從你的角度來看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是提供DNA圖譜的實驗幫兇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以你是來責備我的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}居然還翻到玩偶身上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要處你死刑喔 死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算和事實有差距
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}從結果來看是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}乾脆讓別人責罵一頓還比較舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好 所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你是覺得我不可原諒對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳在說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}當然是在擔心妳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是說謊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但有人對我這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓我多少比較好受...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我才沒說謊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就說我沒說謊 是沒聽懂嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還面不改色地說自己是「實驗動物」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}像白老鼠或天竺鼠那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了研究 全身都被任意玩弄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒用了就丟到焚化爐去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們能正確地理解什麼叫「實驗動物」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們明明知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻還是這麼稱呼自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓這種情況發生的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}必須用我的雙手去拯救她們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳要去哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今天晚上也有實驗會進行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這之前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我要用我僅有的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去和一方通行分出勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.52,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(902.4,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳贏得了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他們說 妳會死在第185招
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是樹狀圖設計者預測演算後所寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.91,Default-furigana,furi,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(777,980)}Tree diagram
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳真的覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打得贏他嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算我竭盡全力 他依舊毫髮無傷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果我連這個價值都沒有的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.31,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比如說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我在他的第一招就輸掉的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「死在第185招」的預測結果就會被推翻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果看到這個結果 讓研究員對計畫產生疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打算重新模擬的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是還有剩餘的用處嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打算去死嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算妳死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳覺得這樣就可以阻止這個計畫嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你知道嗎 對那些研究員來說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}樹狀圖設計者的預測結果就是絕對的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.61,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(655,980)}Tree diagram
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果說我在第一招就慘敗 只能在地上爬著四處逃竄的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}研究員們一定會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「樹狀圖設計者的預測演算也是會有錯誤的」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.43,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(594,980)}Tree diagram
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果說再重新演算的話 妳不就白死了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}樹狀圖設計者在約三個禮拜前就不知道被什麼東西擊落了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:03.23,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(381,980)}Tree diagram
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以已經不可能再重新演算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}連這個都...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}先不管妳去打倒一方通行這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:16.27,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1083,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不能放任抱著必死決心的人離開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要不然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你是有什麼其他方法嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明什麼都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要光說些漂亮話和理想論
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}聽了就不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還是不會讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你還真是難以溝通耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}難道說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你覺得那些複製人死掉也無所謂嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果你還想要阻撓我的話 我就先在這裡把你打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不想被我電的話就給我閃開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是嗎... 看來你是想來硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}確實到目前為止我一次都沒有贏過你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就連現在也不知道你身上到底有什麼能力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是這次我是絕對不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以你也給我認真打
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}否則的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:20.67,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你這是在幹嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是不會跟妳打的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會跟妳打
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你真的是笨蛋嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你以為這樣做我就不會對你出手了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我已經沒有別條路可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管你有沒有抵抗 你敢阻撓我 我一定把你打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我也不會跟你打
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}少給我開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}想跟我打的話就給我握緊拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不想打的話就不要給我擋在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要用那種半吊子的心態來踐踏別人的希望!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我叫你...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我動手啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}騙人...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的攻擊明明不可能對他有效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這和平常攻擊被抵消的感覺不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有貫穿他身體的觸感...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣你懂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是真的會把你...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.65,0:17:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不會跟妳打
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼啊??
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你也知道這個瘋狂的實驗是不對的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你不是應該也要阻止它的嗎 為什麼要阻止我?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是啊 是不對的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}居然去傷害別人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳的作法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻救不了妳自己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不會讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你在說什麼啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事到如今 我已經沒有再聽到這種話的資格了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所有人都能笑著的幸福世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也沒有我的容身之地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳覺得剩下來的妹妹們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真的會感謝妳嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳自己也注意到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳這種做法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}救不了任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你很囉唆耶...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們也...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果我死掉的話也比較輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:18:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只剩下我死掉這個方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果能用一個人的命去救一萬個人不是很棒嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣就好了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請你讓開...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不會讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你果然是個笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明就跟你毫無關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明只要閉上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}裝做什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就可以回到往常的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼還要把自己弄得遍體麟傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說不定連心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都短暫的停止跳動了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼你還露得出笑容啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為很高興妳還能站在我這邊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}別哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我想到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}阻止實驗的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是以一方通行為最強的前提之下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.80,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(776,980)}Accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去進行模擬演算的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要去證明「其實他超弱」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比如說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果他隨便輸給一個學園都市裡面的無能力者的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:20.34,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1392,980)}Level 0
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個前提不就能被推翻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你該不會要...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}去跟他打
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不可能!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他跟我是不同次元的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他是能輕鬆和全世界的軍隊為敵的怪物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.04,0:21:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這次你真的會...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管什麼事情都會幫我解決的媽媽不在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}求求你...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不能讓別人捲進我讓一萬人死掉的罪過中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算是求神明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不會有奇蹟發生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}必須要由我自己一個人解決
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就協助我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不失去任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓大家帶著笑容回來是我的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}拜託妳幫我實現這個夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要哭喊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就會趕來救我的英雄根本就...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳等著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我一定會把御坂妹妹帶回來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就這麼說定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}實驗開始時間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是8點半
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不認為我有勝算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為那個瘋狂計畫她們...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們就得死的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}首先 就讓我來摧毀那愚蠢至極的幻想
Dialogue: 5,0:01:34.15,0:01:37.66,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}Sorrow of your heart…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.99,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)} I shoot it down
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}sister's noise…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5}{\fscx70\fscy70\fad(300,300)\pos(961.5,979.5)}I find it out…
